SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Lampini (Agios Vasileios)
LOCATION:Lampini\, Crete (Rethymno)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Lampini's Byzantine church of the Panagia\, with its frescoes\, is the reason the whole Agios Vasileios valley comes here on 15 August: liturgy in the morning and a glenti in the evening with a well-known lyra player (Andreas Manolarakis in 2019\, Nikos Manioudakis in 2025). Twenty minutes south of Rethymno on the Spili road\, easy to combine with the Preveli coast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/rethymno/#lampini-panigiri-of-the-dormition-lampini-agios-vasileios
